  "prefLabel": "Hab 103.02 Board’s Operation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Hab 103.02 Board’s Operation.\n\n(a) The board’s telephone number is (603) 271-1108, and its website is https://hab.nh.gov. The board’s offices are located at:\n\nGovernor Gallen State Office Park\n\nJohnson Hall\n\n107 Pleasant Street\n\nConcord, NH 03301\n\n(b) The office is open on all legal state work days from 8:00 a.m. to 4:00 p.m.\n\nSource. #13226 eff 7-7-21",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/hab100-300.html"
